Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Store user data under /userdata/system/configs/xenia_edge

Batocera keeps emulator config and content in /userdata, so use that as
the storage root instead of ~/Xenia. Portable mode and -storage_root
still take precedence.
---
 src/xenia/app/xenia_main.cc | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/xenia/app/xenia_main.cc b/src/xenia/app/xenia_main.cc
index c2b49a9..e16521e 100644
--- a/src/xenia/app/xenia_main.cc
+++ b/src/xenia/app/xenia_main.cc
@@ -540,7 +540,7 @@ bool EmulatorApp::OnInitialize() {
 #if XE_PLATFORM_ANDROID
       // TODO(Triang3l): Point to the app's external storage "files" directory.
 #else
-      storage_root = storage_root / "Xenia";
+      storage_root = "/userdata/system/configs/xenia_edge";
 #endif
     }
   }
